title: Outbound IRC Connection
id: 19f410ec-8577-4160-b8df-0c266e7d9ab6
status: experimental
description: Detects outbound connections on IRC ports (6660-6669, 6697) or IRC protocol handshakes from endpoints, a legacy but still-used botnet command-and-control channel rarely seen in enterprises.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1071/
logsource:
  category: firewall
detection:
  selection:
    dst_port:
      - 6660
      - 6667
      - 6669
      - 6697
    direction: 'outbound'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - src_ip
  - dst_ip
  - dst_port
falsepositives:
  - Developers using IRC intentionally
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.command_and_control
  - attack.t1071
